      "finding": "Shelf and ShelfSmall inherit StorageShelfBase -> ShelfBase -> FurnitureBase -> BuildingBase. Size2x1/1x1; each cell3 stacks, total6/3. PathCost50, PassThroughOnly, Item surface, no zone overlap. Minifiable; ComplexFurniture. This chain has no CompProperties_Quality. Cost20/10, Work500/250, HP100/50 are base Def values, not evaluated stuff-adjusted stats.",
